    <h1>Every tool behind your site, <em>explained in plain words</em></h1>
    <p>You should know what runs your website. This page lists every tool I use, what it does for you, and why I chose it over the more popular option. If a term is new to you, the <a href="/glossary/" class="inline-link">glossary</a> explains it.</p>
  </div>
